{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"2":{"eng-name":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)","ara-name":"كتاب الصلاة"}},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1128,"arabicnumber":1128,"text":"Rapporté par Abdullah ibn Umar رضي الله عنه : Nafi’ a dit : Ibn ‘Umar allongeait sa prière avant la prière du vendredi et priait deux rak‘as après, chez lui. Il disait que le Messager d’Allah ﷺ faisait ainsi","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":739},"chapter":{"id":246,"ara-name":"باب الصَّلاَةِ بَعْدَ الْجُمُعَةِ","eng-name":"Praying After The Friday Prayer","isFirstHadith":false}}]}